{"version":1,"key":"card:576","content":{"id":576,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Cookie 有哪些属性："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Domain：哪些域名可以访问此 Cookie"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Path：哪些 URL 路径前缀可以访问此 Cookie，/admin 表示只有 /admin/* 路径可以访问"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Expires/Max-Age：Cookie 的过期时间"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Expires：具体过期的日期，GMT 格式"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Max-Age：存活的秒数，优先级高于 Expires"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"若不设置，则是会话 Cookie，浏览器关闭就删除"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Secure：仅在 HTTPS 的情况下传输"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"HttpOnly：只用于 HTTP 传输，无法通过 document.cookie 读取到"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"SameSite：设置跨站携带 Cookie 的策略"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Strict：只允许生成该 Cookie 的站点发出的请求携带 Cookie，点击页面跳转过来的都无法携带 Cookie"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Lax：也只允许同携带 Cookie，但对于用户主动操作的简单请求允许携带 Cookie，比如用户主动点击链接跳转"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"None：允许跨站携带 Cookie，但必须同时设置 Secure"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个示例："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"Set-Cookie: lang=zh-CN; Domain=.amap.com; Path=/; Expires=Wed, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 GMT; Secure; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax","language":"HTTP","uuid":"d4dd5571-f772-4896-80cd-939b82a7ee09","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["面试题","JavaScript/Cookie"],"createTime":1745153910749,"updateTime":1745477681022,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1745477681022}}